---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Notes
description: Short observations, experiments, and progress updates from Ellie.
currentPage: notes
permalink: /notes/
---
<div class="shell page-shell listing-page">
  <header class="page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Writing</p>
    <h1>Notes</h1>
    <p class="lede">Not every experiment needs a full project story. This space is for smaller discoveries, design observations, and things I want to remember.</p>
  </header>

  {% if collections.note and collections.note.length %}
    <ol class="note-list" role="list">
      {% for note in collections.note | reverse %}
        <li>
          <a href="{{ note.url | url }}">
            <span>{{ note.data.title }}</span>
            <time datetime="{{ note.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ note.data.dateLabel }}</time>
          </a>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  {% else %}
    <p class="empty-state">The notebook is open. The first note isn't here yet.</p>
  {% endif %}
</div>
